tc.research_name.SANITY_CHARM=Talisman of Clarity
tc.research_text.SANITY_CHARM=Shield against eldritch madness
tc.research_page.SANITY_CHARM.1=By binding the purifying properties of soap, amber, and focused mental vis into an amulet, you have forged the Talisman of Clarity.<BR>When equipped in an Amulet, Charm, or Universal slot, it accelerates the dissipation of warp afflictions (nausea, blindness, unnatural hunger) and stabilizes your focus against spontaneous madness.

tc.research_name.WARPSOMETHING=Hunk of Something
tc.research_text.WARPSOMETHING=Writhing catalyst of chaos
tc.research_page.WARPSOMETHING.1=In your alchemical experiments, you discovered that organic flesh subjected to concentrated eldritch and entropy aspects in a crucible transmutes into an unstable, writhing catalyst.<BR>Consuming this anomalous mass induces a violent surge of warp and unpredictable mental hallucinations.

tc.research_name.WARPCLEANSER=Pure Tear
tc.research_text.WARPCLEANSER=Radical soul cleansing
tc.research_page.WARPCLEANSER.1=By infusing a Nether Star with Void Metal, Void Seeds, Salis Mundus, and Ghast Tears upon the Infusion Matrix, you have discovered an endgame method to violently purge all accumulated Warp from your mind.<BR>The process is perilous: purging large amounts of Warp triggers a chaotic mental cascade of eldritch hallucinations and distortions.

tc.research_name.WARPAMULET=Purification Talisman
tc.research_text.WARPAMULET=Continuous warp siphoning
tc.research_page.WARPAMULET.1=By binding Pure Tears, Void Metal, and Sanity Soap into an enchanted bauble, you have created a talisman that continuously siphons mental corruption away from your soul.<BR>Can be equipped in Amulet, Body, Charm, or Universal bauble slots (Baubles-Expanded).

tc.research_name.WARPPAPER=Arcane Litmus Paper
tc.research_text.WARPPAPER=Mental Diagnosis
tc.research_page.WARPPAPER.1=By combining paper with Salis Mundus, Void Seeds, and water essence on an Arcane Worktable, you have created a sensitive diagnostic sheet.<BR>Using the paper instantly measures your mental corruption, providing a precise breakdown of permanent, normal, and temporary Warp.

