tc.research_name.COMPACT_INFUSION_MATRIX=Compact Infusion Matrix
tc.research_text.COMPACT_INFUSION_MATRIX=Multiblock altar in a single block
tc.research_page.COMPACT_INFUSION_MATRIX.1=The traditional Infusion Altar is notoriously massive, demanding dozens of square meters for pedestals, stability stabilizers, and essentia jars.<BR>Through profound dimensional compression and thaumaturgical resonance, you have condensed the entire altar mechanism into a single 1x1 block.<BR>The Compact Infusion Matrix features 1 central input slot, 1 output result slot, 16 component item slots, and 4 dedicated stabilizer upgrade slots.
tc.research_page.COMPACT_INFUSION_MATRIX.2=The matrix automatically pulls Essentia from adjacent or nearby jars (up to 12 blocks) and tubes without spraying flux.<BR>Inserting candles, skulls, sanity soap, or primal charms into the stabilizer slots boosts the internal stability rating to 100%, neutralizing instability events entirely.<BR>Supports full automation via Hoppers, Pipes, and ME Interfaces (Top: Central Input, Bottom: Output, Sides: Components).

# Compact Infernal Furnace
tile.thaumicmadness.compact_infernal_furnace.name=Compact Infernal Furnace
container.compact_infernal_furnace=Compact Infernal Furnace

tc.research_name.COMPACT_INFERNAL_FURNACE=Compact Infernal Furnace
tc.research_text.COMPACT_INFERNAL_FURNACE=Infernal Metallurgy Compressed
tc.research_page.COMPACT_INFERNAL_FURNACE.1=The 3x3x3 Infernal Furnace is imposing, but occupies substantial space and ejects outputs loosely into the environment.<BR>By fusing triple the infernal materials with a Primordial Pearl and a Brain in a Jar, you have engineered a 1x1 compact powerhouse.<BR>It performs hyper-fast smelting, yields double ingots from Native Clusters, and maintains high bonus nugget chances.
tc.research_page.COMPACT_INFERNAL_FURNACE.2=The integrated Brain in a Jar captures 100% of smelting experience into a 30,000 XP internal reservoir.<BR>You can withdraw your stored experience at any time directly through the furnace GUI or by tapping the block with a wand.<BR>Upgrade slots accept up to 2 Arcane Bellows for maximum smelting acceleration and bonus nugget drop rates.<BR>All generated flux is safely contained and neutralized within the core.



