tc.research_name.COMPACT_INFERNAL_FURNACE=Compact Infernal Furnace
tc.research_text.COMPACT_INFERNAL_FURNACE=Infernal Flames in a single block
tc.research_page.COMPACT_INFERNAL_FURNACE.1=The traditional 3x3x3 Infernal Furnace consumes vast amounts of space and pollutes the environment with flux if unattended.<BR>Combining spatial compression, a Brain in a Jar, and a Primordial Pearl, you have compressed the entire mechanism into a 1x1 block.<BR>Features 4 parallel smelting slots, 30,000 XP reservoir, and a flux filtration system.
tc.research_page.COMPACT_INFERNAL_FURNACE.2=Silverwood Filters absorb flux generated during smelting (up to 64 units per filter), transforming into spent tainted filters rich in Vitium essentia.<BR>WARNING: If filters run out, the furnace will vent flux into the air and corrupt the surrounding biome into Tainted Land!
tc.research_name.SILVERWOOD_FILTER=Silverwood Filters
tc.research_text.SILVERWOOD_FILTER=Flux Protection & Taint Recycling
tc.research_page.SILVERWOOD_FILTER.1=The Compact Infernal Furnace emits flux during operation (0.25 units per smelted item).<BR>To protect the environment, specialized Silverwood Filters were engineered.<BR>Each filter can absorb 64 units of flux (equivalent to smelting 256 items), completely neutralizing environmental taint emissions.
tc.research_page.SILVERWOOD_FILTER.2=Once fully saturated, the filter transmutes into a Spent Tainted Filter.<BR>Tainted filters store massive amounts of Vitium essentia (20 units) and Entropy (16 units), making them highly valuable for essentia distillation in the Alchemical Furnace or Crucible.


# ==============================================================================
# Thaumic Madness - Authentic Thaumcraft Researches (English)
# ==============================================================================
tc.research_name.INFUSED_DIRT=Infused Dirt
tc.research_text.INFUSED_DIRT=Elemental Fertility
tc.research_page.INFUSED_DIRT.1=By infusing common soil with Terra essentia and binding clay on the Infusion Matrix, you have created a fertile substrate brimming with telluric vitality.<BR>This magical loam greatly accelerates crop growth and prevents farmland from drying out.
tc.research_page.INFUSED_DIRT.2=Infused dirt acts as the ideal foundation for silverwood groves, mana beans, and rare botanical specimens.

tc.research_name.CONSTANT_VIGILANCE=Constant Vigilance
tc.research_text.CONSTANT_VIGILANCE=Shielding the Mind from the Void
tc.research_page.CONSTANT_VIGILANCE.1=Gazing into the abyss of forbidden arcana, a thaumaturge constantly risks their own sanity. Understanding the ebb and flow of Warp is the crucial first step towards mental preservation.<BR>You have learned to detect subtle ripples in the cognitive ether, paving the way for protective amulets, charms of lucidity, and complete eldritch purgation.

tc.research_name.COMPACT_INFUSION_MATRIX=Compact Infusion Matrix
tc.research_text.COMPACT_INFUSION_MATRIX=Singularity of the Arcane Arts
tc.research_page.COMPACT_INFUSION_MATRIX.1=The traditional Infusion Altar has long represented the zenith of thaumaturgical engineering, yet its sheer bulk and spatial vulnerability pose severe liabilities. Dozens of stone pedestals, strict symmetrical stabilizers, and endless jar arrays leave the laboratory fragile against sudden arcane shockwaves.<BR>Reflecting upon the nature of spatial folding and occult singularities, you achieved a monumental breakthrough. Binding ancient mechanisms, a Primordial Pearl, and dense alchemical matrices, you collapsed the entire infusion field into a single cubic meter.
tc.research_page.COMPACT_INFUSION_MATRIX.2=Within this monolithic block lies an artificial pocket dimension. It houses a central pedestal, a finished artifact receptacle, 16 internal component pedestals, and 4 dedicated stabilizer matrices.<BR>The matrix autonomously siphons essentia from jars within a 12-block radius, completely containing all flux spillover.<BR>Stabilizers (candles, skulls, sanity charms) grant up to 100% ritual stability, eliminating ritual failure.<BR>Fully automatable via hoppers, conduits, and AE2 interfaces.

tc.research_name.COMPACT_INFERNAL_FURNACE=Compact Infernal Furnace
tc.research_text.COMPACT_INFERNAL_FURNACE=Bound Nether Flame
tc.research_page.COMPACT_INFERNAL_FURNACE.1=The colossal 3x3x3 Infernal Furnace harnesses primordial Nether flame for rapid ore smelting. However, temperature regulation was crude and flux fumes routinely polluted the local aura.<BR>Combining a warded obsidian matrix with a Brain in a Jar and a Primordial Pearl, you engineered a 1x1 infernal construct.<BR>The pearl compresses the magma crucible into a localized point, while the preserved cerebral matrix regulates thermal throughput and captures raw cognitive experience.
tc.research_page.COMPACT_INFERNAL_FURNACE.2=The furnace contains 4 independent parallel crucibles. Each input slot smelts independently.<BR>Slotting Arcane Bellows accelerates cooking up to a blistering 0.65 seconds and elevates bonus nugget yields to 70%.<BR>The Brain in a Jar stores up to 30,000 XP, extractable at will via the GUI buttons.<BR>Warning: each smelted item generates 0.25 flux units. Operating without Silverwood filters will rapidly taint the surrounding biome!

tc.research_name.SILVERWOOD_FILTER=Silverwood Filters
tc.research_text.SILVERWOOD_FILTER=Purifying Membranes & Taint Reclamation
tc.research_page.SILVERWOOD_FILTER.1=Silverwood has long been revered for its aura-cleansing resonance. By weaving fine silverwood fibers with silk and setting them with quicksilver droplets at an Arcane Worktable, you created a porous thaumaturgic membrane capable of capturing volatile flux miasma.<BR>A single filter absorbs up to 64 units of flux (256 smelted items in the Compact Infernal Furnace), safeguarding your sanctum from corruption.
tc.research_page.SILVERWOOD_FILTER.2=Once saturated, the silverwood lattice darkens into a Spent Tainted Filter.<BR>While unable to absorb further flux, it becomes an extraordinarily rich source of rare aspects: containing 20 units of Vitium (Taint), 8 units of Entropy, and Tenebrae.<BR>Distilling spent filters in an Alchemical Furnace or Crucible yields concentrated essentia for advanced thaumaturgical arts.

tc.research_name.THAUMONOMICON_ATLAS=Thaumonomicon Atlas
tc.research_text.THAUMONOMICON_ATLAS=Astral Cartography of Aura Nodes
tc.research_page.THAUMONOMICON_ATLAS.1=Mapping aura nodes previously demanded endless wandering across the wilderness with a Thaumometer in hand. Fusing Goggles of Revealing, a Thaumometer, and a Vis Amulet upon the Infusion Matrix, you attuned the Thaumonomicon to resonate with ambient nodes across vast distances.<BR>The Atlas catalogs coordinates, node types, brightness, and real-time aspect capacities, projecting them onto an interactive astral chart with full JourneyMap waypoint integration.
tc.research_page.THAUMONOMICON_ATLAS.2=Opening the Atlas allows instantaneous aspect filtering (Aer, Ignis, Terra, Aqua, Ordo, Perditio, and compound aspects), waypoint navigation, and live monitoring of node depletion.

tc.research_name.SANITY_CHARM=Talisman of Clarity
tc.research_text.SANITY_CHARM=Soothing the Turbulent Mind
tc.research_page.SANITY_CHARM.1=Combining purifying soap, Order crystals, and restorative essences, you forged an amulet radiating waves of serene harmonic stability.<BR>Wearing the charm shields the psyche from sudden Warp tremors and dramatically accelerates the natural dissipation of temporary Warp.

tc.research_name.WARPCLEANSER=Pure Tear
tc.research_text.WARPCLEANSER=Spiritual Catharsis
tc.research_page.WARPCLEANSER.1=Infusing a Nether Star with Void Metal, Void Seeds, Salis Mundus, and Ghast Tears upon the Infusion Matrix, you uncovered a method to violently purge all accumulated Warp from your mind.<BR>This process carries extreme danger: purging vast amounts of Warp unleashes a chaotic cognitive storm of eldritch hallucinations and reality tremors.

tc.research_name.WARPAMULET=Purification Talisman
tc.research_text.WARPAMULET=Continuous Taint Absorption
tc.research_page.WARPAMULET.1=Binding Pure Tears, Void Metal, and Sanitizing Soap into an enchanted bauble, you created an artifact that continually drains corruption from your soul.<BR>Equippable in amulet, body, charm, or expanded Baubles slots.

tc.research_name.WARPPAPER=Arcane Litmus Paper
tc.research_text.WARPPAPER=Psychic Diagnostic Parchment
tc.research_page.WARPPAPER.1=Combining parchment with Salis Mundus, Void Seeds, and Aqua essentia at the Arcane Worktable, you created an indicator scroll.<BR>Using the parchment instantly reveals your current Warp levels, categorized into Permanent, Normal, and Temporary distortion.

tc.research_name.WARPSOMETHING=Unstable Catalyst
tc.research_text.WARPSOMETHING=Concentrated Primal Entropy
tc.research_page.WARPSOMETHING.1=Mixing rotten flesh, redstone, and Entropy essentia in a Crucible produces a pulsating mass of raw chaotic matter.<BR>Consumption causes unpredictable transmutations and sudden Warp spikes.
tc.research_name.REF_INFUSION=Infusion Matrix
tc.research_text.REF_INFUSION=Foundational Infusion Mechanics
tc.research_page.REF_INFUSION.1=The original Infusion Matrix (from the Artifice tab) provides the essential prerequisite for compact infusion singularities.

tc.research_name.REF_INFERNALFURNACE=Infernal Furnace
tc.research_text.REF_INFERNALFURNACE=Foundational Nether Metallurgy
tc.research_page.REF_INFERNALFURNACE.1=The colossal Infernal Furnace (from the Artifice tab) serves as the basis for hyper-compressed infernal crucibles.

tc.research_name.REF_JARBRAIN=Brain in a Jar
tc.research_text.REF_JARBRAIN=Experience Retention
tc.research_page.REF_JARBRAIN.1=The Brain in a Jar (from the Artifice tab) is employed for the accumulation and preservation of mental experience.
